maniT Concurrency Demo
======================

--- 1. Basic channel + spawn ---
  producer sends: 1
  producer sends: 2
  producer sends: 3
  producer sends: 4
  producer sends: 5
  consumer got:  1
  consumer got:  2
  consumer got:  3
  consumer got:  4
  consumer got:  5
  sum = 15

--- 2. Producer-consumer pipeline ---
  Sum of 1..20 = 210

--- 3. Mutex<int> shared counter ---
  Final counter value (expected 900): 900

--- 4. AtomicTrit lifecycle flag ---
  Initial status: -
  [task] running...
  [task] done.
  [main] task completed.

--- 5. Barrier (3-thread synchronisation) ---
  thread 0 before barrier
  thread 0 after barrier
  thread 1 before barrier
  thread 1 after barrier
  thread 2 before barrier
  thread 2 is the barrier leader
  thread 2 after barrier
  All threads passed the barrier.

--- 6. async/await fan-out ---
  processed: data-1
  processed: data-2
  processed: data-3
  processed: data-4
  processed: data-5
  Squares: 1, 4, 9, 16, 25

